n class=\"-grid--custom\" data-instance-id=\"2TopVInNp4\"><div class=\"-card\"><h2 class=\"-lines--\" data-instance-id=\"Cm2JuipH1T\">The Commerz Real Group</h2><div class=\"-embed -dimensions-- -layout-- -spacing--\" data-instance-id=\"5fUGRYLzfd\">35,5 Billion Euro assets under management, more than 4.000+ tenants, more than 800 employees. This is Commerz Real in figures. We are proud of this achievement, no question. But what drives our company, what motivates us every day, is our mission – and that goes far beyond pure returns or occupancy rates. Because we believe that it is not the most capital, but the best ideas that drive the world forward. \n\nThat’s why we see it as our mission to invest in ideas and concepts that create real, tangible value – small or large. Values that make a difference on a personal, social and environmental level. This is the only way to sustainably increase economic success for our customers and for us.</div></div></section>",
